	<h2>Sprint two: RAA Travel discovery</h2>
	<p>
		The second sprint was part of discovery for rebuilding the RAA Travel booking platform. It brought together product
		managers, travel agents, marketing and engineering. I co-facilitated it, ran in-store customer interviews alongside
		the product manager beforehand, and designed the prototypes.
	</p>
	<p>
		We mapped the whole customer journey on a whiteboard, from first ideas to booking and after travel, with the
		behind-the-scenes constraints from travel operations shown alongside what customers see. The outputs shaped the
		design direction for the rebuild.
	</p>
